        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Consumption & Excess</strong></p>\n<p>A god of appetite in a world of scarcity — the crueler for it. Followers rarely stay satisfied for long, by design.</p>\n<p><strong>Areas of Concern</strong> hunger, want, the meal that never comes</p>\n<p><strong>Edicts</strong> never turn down a chance to take more than offered; carry the hunger visibly</p>\n<p><strong>Anathema</strong> waste food or power you've already claimed; let a craving go unacknowledged</p>\n<p><strong>Religious Symbol</strong> an empty bowl, licked clean</p>\n<p><strong>Sacred Animal</strong> locust</p>\n<p><strong>Sacred Colors</strong> famine grey, ration-line brown</p>"
